.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH bap-repl 1  "bap-repl " 
.SH NAME
bap\-repl \- Start an interactive REPL
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbap\-repl\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Start an interactive REPL
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH EXTRA
Dot commands inside the REPL:
  .help    list commands
  .metrics toggle timing output
  .clear   clear the screen
  .exit    leave the REPL (Ctrl\-D also works)
